== half the fee on the fourth night
tier: everyday
sphere: arts
haunt: arts.song
ladder: known
rate: 0.5
share: .0015
stages: young_adult adult mature
age: 18-70
calls: RB
holds: touring musician
tone: trouble
life: work, friends
horizon: moment
roles: friend
earth: on the fourth night of the tour the venue pays the band half the agreed fee, and there is not enough fuel to reach the next town
times: Most touring musicians, now and then; small venues paying short after a thin night is a common trouble of the road (estimate)
gap: 0.5-2
scene: It is the fourth night of the tour, and the room was half empty. The venue's manager counts out half the agreed fee and says that is all there is. The van needs fuel to reach the next town by tomorrow.
scene W: The fee was agreed in writing. {N} wants what is fair, no more and no less.
scene U: {N} counted the door: ninety paid. The manager's numbers do not add up.
scene B: Word travels between venues. A band that lets one manager pay half gets paid half everywhere.
scene R: {N} played their heart out to the people who came, and now this. {Ns} temper is rising.
scene G: {friend} has been in the band since school. Whatever happens tonight, the band stays together.
- W | show the manager the written agreement and ask for the rest | v: conformity, security | sphere: arts.W | chance: 75
- U | ask to see the door count and the bar takings before taking anything | v: achievement, security | sphere: arts.U | chance: 75
- B | take the half, and warn the manager the band will name the venue online | v: power | sphere: arts.B | chance: 75
- R | refuse to load the van until the full fee is on the table | v: self-direction, stimulation | sphere: arts.R | chance: 75
- G | take what is offered and share it out evenly among the band | v: benevolence, tradition | sphere: arts.G | chance: 75
- W>U | write down every date's fee and head count, and send it to the agent tonight | v: conformity, achievement | sphere: arts.W | chance: 65
- U>B | work out a deal: half now, the rest from next month's bar takings | v: security, achievement | sphere: arts.U | chance: 65
- B>R | sell every last record and shirt at the door before the room empties | v: achievement, stimulation | sphere: arts.B | chance: 65
- R>G | get the band busking in the square at midnight for the fuel money | v: stimulation, benevolence | sphere: arts.R | chance: 65
- G>W | ring the band that played here last month and ask what they were paid | v: universalism, tradition | sphere: arts.G | chance: 65
works: The van reaches the next town on time, and the band laugh about the night for years.
works: The manager finds the missing money in the bar till, and the band are booked again next year.
fails: The band leave with half, a long night ahead, and a hole in the tour's money.
fails: Words are said at the door, and the manager warns every venue in the region about the band.

