scene U: It started after the bad night in the third town, and it is worse every evening. Something is going on with {friend}.
scene B: A booker from a bigger festival is coming to Saturday's show. One more bad night could cost the whole band.
scene R: {N} is angry, and frightened for {friend}, and wants to have it out tonight.
scene G: They have played together since they were fourteen, and the two families sit together at every home show.
