- R>W | stop drinking yourself for the rest of the tour, and ask them to join you | act: stop drinking themselves for the rest of the tour, and ask their friend to join them | v: self-direction, conformity | self_control: + | sphere: arts.R | chance: 65
- G>U | ring an older musician who got sober on the road and ask what helped | v: tradition, benevolence | sphere: arts.G | chance: 65
works: {friend} plays Saturday sober, and the band are offered the bigger festival.
works: {friend} admits it at last on the drive home, and starts to cut down.
fails: {friend} storms off after a row in the van, and the tour ends a week early.
fails: The drinking goes on, and the booker leaves Saturday's show halfway through.

