earth: at the craft fair the stall next to yours sells cheap factory copies of your best design
times: Many craft makers who sell at fairs, now and then; copied designs are a common complaint of makers (estimate)
gap: 1-4
scene: At the summer craft fair, the stall next to {Ns} is selling copies of {Ns} best design: the same shape and pattern, made in a factory somewhere, at a third of the price.
scene W: The fair has a rule that everything sold must be made by the seller. The stall next door is breaking it in plain sight.
scene U: Up close the copies are rough: the glaze runs and the bases are not level. Anyone who looks can see the difference.
scene B: Every sale next door is a sale {N} has lost. The fair's three days are a quarter of the year's takings.
scene R: {N} wants to walk over and say exactly what {N} thinks, in front of the customers.
scene G: The fair's makers have known each other for years. They look out for one another, and {friend} at the stall opposite is watching.
- W | report the stall to the fair's organisers under the makers' rule | v: conformity, universalism | lever: voice | sphere: arts.W | chance: 75
- U | set one original beside one copy, and let buyers compare them | v: achievement | sphere: arts.U | chance: 75
- B | cut your prices for the weekend and outsell them | act: cut their prices for the weekend and outsell them | v: achievement, power | sphere: arts.B | chance: 75
- R | march over and tell the stallholder what you think, in front of everyone | act: march over and tell the stallholder what they think, in front of everyone | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: made an enemy | sphere: arts.R | chance: 75
- G | ask the other makers to stand together and go to the organisers as one | v: tradition, universalism | sphere: arts.G | chance: 75
- W>B | ask the organisers to refund your pitch fee if the stall stays | act: ask the organisers to refund their pitch fee if the stall stays | v: security, conformity | sphere: arts.W | chance: 65
- U>R | work at the wheel all afternoon, so buyers watch the real thing being made | v: stimulation, achievement | sphere: arts.U | chance: 65
- B>G | offer the stallholder a deal: sell your real work instead, for a share | act: offer the stallholder a deal: sell their real work instead, for a share | v: power, benevolence | sphere: arts.B | chance: 65
- R>W | put up a big hand-painted sign: the originals are made at this stall | v: self-direction, universalism | sphere: arts.R | chance: 65
- G>U | tell every buyer who stops where the design came from and who taught it | v: tradition | sphere: arts.G | chance: 65
works: By Sunday the copies are gone from the next stall, and {Ns} table is busier than ever.
